{{Term/Store|Cool Safflina|Cool Safflinas|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Cool Safflina}}
Cool Safflinas can be found growing in the snow of the [[Hebra Mountains]] and [[Gerudo Highlands]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They also sprout near [[Tera's Great Fairy Fountain]] in the [[Gerudo Desert]]. [[Cooking]] Cool Safflinas in a [[Cooking Pot]] will result in [[Meal]]s that grant [[Link]] [[Heat Resistance]] when eaten.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] in [[Hateno Village]], Cool Safflinas can be used to create [[Light Blue Dye]].

